From: Marco Müller <hello@annoyedmilk.ch>
Subject: [PATCH] host: skip debugfs without CONFIG_DEBUG_FS

Without CONFIG_DEBUG_FS, debugfs_create_dir() returns an error pointer,
and each boot logged a warning that the directory cannot be created.
The driver works without debugfs, so do not try.

Upstream: not sent
---
--- a/host/esp_debugfs.c
+++ b/host/esp_debugfs.c
@@ -199,6 +199,9 @@
 {
 	struct esp32_debugfs *debugfs = &drv_debugfs;
 
+	if (!IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_DEBUG_FS))
+		return 0;
+
 	debugfs->debugfs_dir = debugfs_create_dir(DEBUGFS_DIR_NAME, NULL);
 	if (IS_ERR_OR_NULL(debugfs->debugfs_dir)) {
 		esp_warn("Failed to create debugfs %s directory\n", DEBUGFS_DIR_NAME);
